  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Agro-Marketing Programme (RAMP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">q	1) To improve the agronomic practices of 2000 smallholder farm producers by introducing improved techniques 
2) To promote diversification of both food and cash crop production by promoting small grain production (2500) and facilitating linkages between 500 smallholder farm producers and the market
3) To pilot test the viability preservation, processing and marketing of fruit with 100 farmers in two wards of Masvingo District</narrative>
  </description>
